{
  "name": "@dsh-external/dsh-closedloop-mode",
  "version": "0.7.4",
  "description": "分级模式 v0.1.0 · 最优律驱动（LQR 结构律）：小类=可推导闭合的增量块。每块 optimal_declare 契约（不变式链/预测值含来源/代价权重/偏差策略 law/双通道 measure/ΔV 序带预期+dip 例外）→ 实现 → optimal_converge 三要素（cost-to-go 严格降×数值「≠」非同源复算×双通道一致）closed 自动打卡；invalidated=re-linearize（模型签名反漂移,定理6）。保留两级锁定/审核规格单/组收官/红队门/审计面板，共 10 工具。",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "private": false,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "types": "./lib/types/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/types/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "src",
    "lib",
    "scripts",
    "client",
    "docs",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.0.1-rc"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.18.2"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node scripts/build.mjs",
    "test": "node --test \"tests/*.test.mjs\"",
    "audit:mutation": "node scripts/mutation-audit.mjs"
  }
}
